Usage: agent-deck [-p profile] conductor <command>

Manage named conductor sessions for meta-agent orchestration.
Multiple conductors can exist per profile.

Commands:
  setup <name>     Set up a named conductor
  teardown <name>  Stop and optionally remove a conductor (or --all)
  status [name]    Show conductor health (all or specific)
  list             List all configured conductors
  move <name>      Move a conductor to another profile (--to-profile)
  migrate-dir <path>  Relocate the conductor base dir (move homes + reconcile daemons)
  heartbeat-tick <name>  Print the delta-only heartbeat message (empty when nothing changed)
  help             Show this help

Examples:
  agent-deck -p work conductor setup ryan --description "Ryan project"
  agent-deck -p work conductor setup review --agent codex --description "Codex reviewer"
  agent-deck -p work conductor setup infra --no-heartbeat
  agent-deck conductor list
  agent-deck conductor status
  agent-deck conductor teardown infra --remove
  agent-deck conductor teardown --all --remove
  agent-deck conductor move ryan --to-profile march
  agent-deck conductor migrate-dir ~/vault/conductors          # dry-run plan
  agent-deck conductor migrate-dir ~/vault/conductors --apply  # perform
